WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Kate Moreno: Hi Daniel, good to see you. How did the week go?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Daniel Hart: Better than last time. I sent four applications, two more than we agreed.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Kate Moreno: That's great. Any replies yet?

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Daniel Hart: One recruiter called. Product manager role at a fintech. Interview on Thursday. I'm nervous about the salary question.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Kate Moreno: Let's work on that today. What number do you have in mind?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:48.000
Daniel Hart: I earn 62 now. I'd like 75 but I'm afraid to say it.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:20.000
Kate Moreno: So the plan: you research three salary sources by Wednesday, and we rehearse the answer. I'll send you the negotiation checklist.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:25.000
Daniel Hart: Deal. Same time next week?
